      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2016 Tuberculosis Association of India. Published by Elsevier B.V. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Involvement of the prostate by tuberculosis (TB) occurs rarely and tuberculosis prostate abscess is an even rarer occurrence. It has been reported in immunocompromised patients, mainly human immunodeficiency virus seropositive individuals. We are reporting a case of tuberculosis prostatic abscess in an immunocompetent patient with relapse of TB."
      },
